cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Aktua in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Aktua: a small programming language for control systems"
abstract: >-
  Aktua is a small, experimental programming language for control
  systems and numerical computing, written in C. It provides transfer
  functions, LTI simulation, tensors and terminal plotting, and can be
  used interactively through a REPL or to run scripts.
authors:
